# DevMind AI Cursor Rules
- FastAPI backend, React + Tailwind + Firebase frontend.
- Type hints everywhere, Pydantic v2, async endpoints.
- Routers stay thin; business logic in services/.
- All LLM calls through backend/app/services/llm_gateway.py only.
- Prompts live in backend/app/prompts/, never hardcoded in routers.
- Firebase handles Auth and Firestore database.
- Functional React components, Tailwind styling, Lucide icons, Monaco editor.
- Always validate schemas, sanitize prompts, and write pytest tests.
